               "PostMention": ""
            },
            {
               "text": "<p><div class=\"htSlides\"><div class=\"htSlide\"><div class=\"htSlideCounter\">1 / 2</div><img class=\"imgGameSize\" id=\"imgSCP\" onclick=\"htImageZoom('imgSCP', '0%')\"><div class=\"htSlideCaption\">Photo taken at the San Andrés Archaeological Park on <htdate0>, during a visit to the site (<htcite0>).</div><div class=\"htSlideRefs\"><b>Related content:</b><ul><li>Physics: Always present - many times we are so focused on ourselves or on opposites that we do not notice what is always present. (<htcite1>)</li></ul></div></div><div class=\"htSlide\"><div class=\"htSlideCounter\">2 / 2</div><img class=\"imgGameSize\" id=\"imgSanAndres0\" onclick=\"htImageZoom('imgSanAndres0', '0%')\"><div class=\"htSlideCaption\">Pyramid at the archaeological site of San Andrés, El Salvador. Photo taken on <htdate1>, during a visit to the site (<htcite2>).</div><div class=\"htSlideRefs\"><b>Related content:</b><ul><li>Translation game (Part I) - Explore numbers from different cultures through an engaging translation game. (<htcite3>)</li><li>The result is - a game of consecutive sums that helps uncover the story. (<htcite4>)</li><li>The result is (Phase II) - a game to reinforce the connection between addition and multiplication. (<htcite5>)</li></ul></div></div><i class=\"fa-solid fa-chevron-left htSlidePrev\" onclick=\"htPlusDivs(-1);\"></i><i class=\"fa-solid fa-chevron-right htSlideNext\" onclick=\"htPlusDivs(1);\"></i></div></p>",
